# Atheros QCA6174 (168c:003e) on the Coral Dev Board, reached over pcie0.
# The part reports no subsystem ids, so board-2.bin cannot match it and
# ath10k falls back to the generic board.bin - keep the whole directory
# rather than guessing which files the driver will ask for.
ath10k/QCA6174/hw3.0/*
